@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System State Diagram

[*] --> RegisterOrLogin

state "Register" as Register
Register : entry / start state
Register : do / create an account
Register : exit / registration complete or unsuccessful

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / user logs in with credentials
Login : do / verify login details
Login : exit / login successful or unsuccessful

RegisterOrLogin --> Register
RegisterOrLogin --> Login

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / user checks weather for a location
CheckWeather : do / check if the entered location is valid
CheckWeather : exit / location validation complete

state "Invalid Location" as InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry / location not valid
InvalidLocation : do / end process
InvalidLocation : exit / session ends

CheckWeather --> CheckWeather : [location valid]
CheckWeather --> InvalidLocation : [location invalid]

state "Select Weather Info" as SelectInfo
SelectInfo : entry / user selects weather information to check
SelectInfo : do / select temperature, humidity, rainfall, pressure, or dew point
SelectInfo : exit / selection complete

state "Show Weather Info" as ShowInfo
ShowInfo : entry / display selected weather information
ShowInfo : do / update and show the selected weather info
ShowInfo : exit / info displayed

CheckWeather --> SelectInfo : [location valid]
SelectInfo --> ShowInfo

state "View Additional Details" as ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / user views additional details
ViewDetails : do / view alerts, weekly analysis, future prediction, or graph
ViewDetails : exit / details viewed

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / user logs out
Logout : do / end session
Logout : exit / session ends

CheckWeather --> ViewDetails
SelectInfo --> ViewDetails
ShowInfo --> ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> Logout

Login --> CheckWeather
Register --> Login

InvalidLocation --> [*]

@enduml
